<!-- LIQUID_CONTAINERS_REDRAW_NO_MANA_POTIONS: the bottle, bucket and barrel in the four looks (owner 2026-10-16: "They too
     should have the four styles of art."; sheet approved 100% the same day; by card: material colour on the TRIM only, body
     keeps its painted style, liquid shows in the masked window). CutoutComplex: each texture has a _m mask, red = the liquid
     window (DrawColor, RM_CompContainerMaterial.ForceColor), green = the trim (DrawColorTwo = material,
     RM_LiquidContainer), black = painted, never tinted. Picked on the crafting bill (Source/LiquidTypes/RM_ContainerStyles.cs);
     no StyleCategoryDef lists these, so no ideoligion can hand them out. drawSize = each ItemBase's (a style never resizes).
     Design: design/RimMandrake/liquid_containers_four_styles_2026-10-16.md. -->
